    "title": "Sports Card Investor",
    "description": "Welcome to the world of sports cards - reimagined.\r\n\r\nWith this all new Sports Card Investor app you can scour through trending cards, search by player, price, year and sport. From there you can scroll through all of the buy it now options on eBay, view the most recent sale prices, and look at how the card is trending over the past 7 & 30 days with data powered by Market Movers.\r\n\r\nWant to check out Sports Card Investor's latest content- we have you covered there too! Access latest shows, articles, card picks, and events all at the tip of your fingers!\r\n\r\nThis is your one stop shop for all lovers of the hobby!",
